						Understanding manufacturing lead times is crucial for inventory planning, seasonal launches, and cash flow management. Bangladesh offers competitive lead times while maintaining quality standards.
					</p>
					<p class="text-white/80">
						With {companyAge} of manufacturing excellence and optimized production processes, Bangladesh factories deliver reliable timelines that help global brands meet their market deadlines consistently.
